We're the same.

1114
00:44:59.330 --> 00:44:59.380
Yeah.

1115
00:44:59.530 --> 00:45:00.230
Look at us.

1116
00:45:00.230 --> 00:45:00.790
Mm-hmm.

1117
00:45:01.010 --> 00:45:01.630
Mm-hmm.

1118
00:45:01.850 --> 00:45:05.530
I'm 95% the reformer, 89% the investigator.

1119
00:45:05.890 --> 00:45:06.110
Ooh.

1120
00:45:06.490 --> 00:45:08.010
89% the challenger.

1121
00:45:08.550 --> 00:45:08.790
Okay.

1122
00:45:09.130 --> 00:45:10.170
What are you the least?

1123
