The loyalist?

1125
00:45:14.070 --> 00:45:14.550
LoyaliSt.

1126
00:45:14.810 --> 00:45:15.010
Okay.

1127
00:45:15.010 --> 00:45:15.690
That's weird.

1128
00:45:15.970 --> 00:45:16.130
Yeah.

1129
